    "created_at": "2016-07-28T07:29:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-28T07:29:27Z",
    "body": "I'd like @smaug---- to explain what he thinks \"trusted\" means. Is it basically all events the user agent decides to dispatch? Is the click event following from `click()` trusted? Are the progress events on `XMLHttpRequest` (to some extent controlled by the server). I think at some point I thought I knew what trusted meant, but it's no longer clear to me.\n",
